# Only the release PR may change a CHANGELOG.md (scripts/check-release-files.mjs
# enforces that), so this line means: every release needs the owner's approval.
# Feature PRs touch no owned file and need none.
#
# Not owned here, on purpose: the release machinery (.github/, scripts/,
# .changeset/config.json, the root manifests). A sole owner cannot approve his
# own pull request, so owning those paths would block every change to them.
# entry-fi/web-libs owns them with a team, so that this file and the workflows
# cannot be changed unreviewed.
/packages/*/CHANGELOG.md @olegshilov
